START
  ↓
Input Array
  ↓
Call RecursiveInsertionSort(A, n)
  ↓
Is n <= 1?
 ├── YES → RETURN
 ↓ NO
RecursiveInsertionSort(A, n-1)
  ↓
key = A[n-1]
  ↓
j = n-2
  ↓
j >= 0 AND A[j] > key?
 ├── YES
 │    ↓
 │  A[j+1] = A[j]
 │    ↓
 │  j = j-1
 │    ↓
 │  Back to condition
 │
 └── NO
      ↓
A[j+1] = key
      ↓
RETURN
      ↓
Print Sorted Array
      ↓
END